  "description": "Demolition of existing garage to the rear garden of 32 Seymore Avenue\nErection of New garage to the rear garden of 32 Seymore Avenue",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Commencement of development (Full Permission)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development to which\r\nthis permission relates shall be commenced not later than the expiration of 3\r\nyears from the date of this permission.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason:</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">  To comply with Section 91\r\n(as amended) of the Town & Country Planning Act 1990.</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Approved Plans</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out\r\nin accordance with the following approved plans: [</span></span>PJ259-10-003,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">PJ259-10-004,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">PJ259-10-005,</p><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">PJ259-10-006]</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper\r\nplanning</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">External Materials as Specified</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The facing materials to be used for the\r\ndevelopment hereby permitted shall be those specified in the application form\r\nunless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To ensure a satisfactory\r\nappearance of the development and to comply with the following Development Plan\r\npolicies for Merton: policies D4 and D8 of the London Plan 2021, policies D12.1\r\nand D12.3 of the Local Plan 2024.</span><s></s></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">No Use of Flat Roof</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">  - Access to\r\nthe flat roof of the development hereby permitted shall be for maintenance or\r\nemergency purposes only, and the flat roof shall not be used as a roof garden,\r\nterrace, patio or similar amenity area.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To safeguard the\r\namenities and privacy of the occupiers of adjoining properties and to comply\r\nwith the following Development Plan policies for Merton: policies D3 and D4 of\r\nthe London Plan 2021 and policies D12.3 & D12.4</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\" aptos\",sans-serif;=\"\" mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:\"times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:=\"\" en-us;mso-bidi-language:ar-sa\"=\"\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%;\">of the Local Plan\r\n2024. </span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ancillary Residential Accommodation</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall not be rented, sold independently\r\nor occupied at any time other than for purposes ancillary to the main\r\nresidential use of the dwelling known as 32 Seymour Avenue, SM4 4RD.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" arial\",sans-serif\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To safeguard the amenities of neighbouring\r\nresidents, to prevent the unauthorised introduction of an independent use and\r\nto ensure compliance with the following Development Plan policies for Merton:\r\npolicies D3 and D4 of the London Plan 2021 and policies D12.1 &amp; D12.3 of\r\nthe Local Plan 2024.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"
  ],
